      "content": "thanks, that's a decent start but it feels a bit too \"textbook.\" for a high school debate, my student needs to actually win the argument. can you give me some sharper, more aggressive talking points? like, instead of just saying \"it's expensive,\" give me the kind of argument that makes the pro-UBI side look completely unrealistic or out of touch with how the economy actually works.",
